      37: {"prompt":"You feel really sad, and a kind stranger asks if they can walk with you. What do you do?","options":["Tell them what's wrong","Say: just leave me alone"],"replies":[["Cleopas told the stranger everything, and it turned out to be Jesus! Sharing sadness with others can help a lot."],["When we're sad, we sometimes want to be alone. But Jesus came close to the sad disciples anyway, and their hearts began to burn with hope."]],"ref":"Luke 24:15-32"},
