      39: {"prompt":"God asks you to go and help someone who has been really mean. You're scared. What do you do?","options":["Trust God and go","Refuse to go"],"replies":[["Like Ananias! He was afraid, but he went and called Saul 'Brother.' God changed Saul's heart completely."],["Ananias felt the same way at first! He told God he was scared. But God said, 'Go,' and Ananias obeyed, and something wonderful happened."]],"ref":"Acts 9:10-18"},
